    fix(ci): recognize the inactive EventStore catalog qualification
    
    Keep the FrontComposer catalog profile on its unique literal Tenants default
    while recognizing only the exact package-only override for five EventStore
    qualification projects. Other profiles and malformed or broadened scopes
    retain strict rejection.
    
    Cover temporary-hook removal, caller opt-in, scope/value mutations, placement,
    duplicates and invalid defaults without changing dependency policy or packages.
